@startuml
title ASII-08 - Migracion razonada: Micro-HIS -> cliente-servidor

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

package "ANTES (semanas 3-4)\nMicro-HIS - monolito local" as Antes {
    component ConsoleApplication
    component TransferPatient as TP1
    component DischargePatient as DP1
    interface AdmissionRepository as AR1
    interface BedRepository as BR1
    component PdoAdmissionRepository
    component PdoBedRepository
    database "SQLite\n(un solo proceso)" as SQLite
}

package "DESPUES (implementado)\nCliente-servidor REST" as Despues {
    component "Clientes HTTP\n(Vue, Postman, otros servicios)" as Cliente
    component TransferController
    component DischargeController
    component TransferPatientService as TP2
    component DischargePatientService as DP2
    interface AdmissionRepositoryInterface as AR2
    interface BedRepositoryInterface as BR2
    component EloquentAdmissionRepository
    component EloquentBedRepository
    database "PostgreSQL\n(multi-tenant, red)" as PG
}

ConsoleApplication --> TP1
ConsoleApplication --> DP1
TP1 --> AR1
TP1 --> BR1
DP1 --> AR1
PdoAdmissionRepository ..|> AR1
PdoBedRepository ..|> BR1
PdoAdmissionRepository --> SQLite
PdoBedRepository --> SQLite

Cliente --> TransferController : HTTP POST\n+ JWT
Cliente --> DischargeController : HTTP POST\n+ JWT
TransferController --> TP2
DischargeController --> DP2
TP2 --> AR2
TP2 --> BR2
DP2 --> AR2
EloquentAdmissionRepository ..|> AR2
EloquentBedRepository ..|> BR2
EloquentAdmissionRepository --> PG
EloquentBedRepository --> PG

Antes -[hidden]right-> Despues

note bottom of Despues
Lo que NO cambio en la migracion: las reglas de dominio
(admision activa, cama origen->limpieza, destino->ocupada,
atomicidad) y los nombres/forma de los casos de uso.
Lo que SI cambio: el canal de entrada (consola -> HTTP+JWT),
el motor de persistencia (SQLite proceso unico -> PostgreSQL
multi-tenant en red) y las interfaces Repository concretas.
end note

@enduml
